# Its key scripts on the data TEST/T_SCR.SH seeds, INV.MSG beside it;
# P, Q, R, S and T on eleven items, TEST/KEYS/WLLONG.REQ's after the seed;
# V the headings' clicks and the dividers' drags; W a drag shorter than
# half a character, the rows that stored widths cost and a list without
